
Component	Requirement
Python	3.8+ locally; 3.11 in container
Flask	3.x
prometheus-client	Python metrics library
Docker	Docker Engine / Desktop
Docker Compose	Compose v2
Prometheus	Containerized
Grafana	Containerized
Ports	5000, 9090, 3000

Step A — Set Grafana administrator password
In Linux, macOS, or WSL Bash:


read -rsp "Grafana admin password: " GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD
echo
export GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD

Step B — Start services
From the Experiment 9 folder:


docker compose config
docker compose up -d --build
docker compose ps


Step C — Generate traffic and verify metrics

curl http://localhost:5000/
curl http://localhost:5000/health
curl http://localhost:5000/metrics

# Simulate an error
curl -i http://localhost:5000/error

# Verify monitoring services
curl http://localhost:9090/-/healthy
curl http://localhost:3000/api/health


